01:30:12,000 --> 01:30:18,000
Zeitgeist is a series of three documentary films released between 2007 and 2011 that present a number
of conspiracy theories, as well as proposals for broad social and economic changes.

12
01:38:24,000 --> 01:38:30,000
The films, Zeitgeist: The Movie (2007), Zeitgeist: Addendum (2008) and
Zeitgeist: Moving Forward (2011) are all directed by Peter Joseph.

13
01:46:36,000 --> 01:46:42,000
The film explores themes of corruption, war on terror,
economic theory, banking, president.

14
01:54:48,000 --> 01:54:54,000
The tone is lighthearted.
